ared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"-b56__bDEGYnCkCK-zOvKg","review_id":"jF8IRsD2sTGT0u4HY2M2LA","date":"2017-06-20T21:13:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9421594142913818,"text_excerpt":"Such a great little place! After seeing a few folks check in here, we decided to head over and see what it was all about. I just love tiki bars- fruity drinks in fun cups and glasses with a tropic atmosphere. What's not to love? This bar is tucked into the middle of a neighborhood, so it might be a bit hard to find at first. Fortunately, it's positioned nicely under a street light, so it's not too hard to miss. I decided to get their house punch, which was fruity, really good and served in a cute tiki cup complete with umbrella and mermaid. If tiki drinks aren't your thing, they have a full bar and a nice selection of local beers. They also serve food, if you're hungry. I only tried one d..."},{"business_id":"-b56__bDEGYnCkCK-zOvKg","review_id":"BG3ZaUh5_FmBc0xgt2_3AA","date":"2021-06-26T16:14:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9384719729423523,"text_excerpt":"I pop into the Portside Lounge regularly on Sundays for a couple of drinks, catch some live music, and take away a few pounds of boiled crawfish. Tiki cocktails here are terrific, and well priced. This is a gem of a neighborhood tiki dive. Portside is way off the beaten tourist path in a Central City neighborhood. It's a meeting place for some local krewes and social clubs. It has a music stage, a back dining/drinking area, and that dark, cool, mysterious feel that you want in a tiki bar. Danny and his staff are incredibly welcoming and friendly."},{"business_id":"-b56__bDEGYnCkCK-zOvKg","review_id":"UocSspbBUauXSZEaNkLs1Q","date":"2017-12-08T06:06:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9374282956123352,"text_excerpt":"So happy to have discovered Portside, a relatively new tiki bar in our neighborhood. The walk in from St. Charles isn't bad... they are three blocks up (lakeside) from the avenue and it's worth it for the drinks, which are fantastic. After a bad experience trying to get a daiquiri elsewhere in town (I'm looking at you, SoBou) I was thrilled to try the Satsuma Daiquiri at Portside (satsumas being newly in season). The drink was perfectly balanced and delicious and the vibe inside was awesome. Love this place."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"-b56__bDEGYnCkCK-zOvKg","photo_id":"Y_JP3cpIOn2IvXf5EA-w6w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Y_JP3cpIOn2IvXf5EA-w6w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9058805704116821},{"business_id":"-b56__bDEGYnCkCK-zOvKg","photo_id":"KSzMSVMVU32zyRdWDB0R7g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KSzMSVMVU32zyRdWDB0R7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.815599799156189},{"business_id":"-b56__bDEGYnCkCK-zOvKg","photo_id":"2vYkUus3PoUH1RERQRNjrA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2vYkUus3PoUH1RERQRNjrA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.81263267993927}]},"notebook_case":null}
